/bin/zsh -lc "wc -l /Users/iv/.agents/skills/project-management/SKILL.md && sed -n '981,1400p' /Users/iv/.agents/skills/project-management/SKILL.md" in /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/curator
 succeeded in 0ms:
    1533 /Users/iv/.agents/skills/project-management/SKILL.md
#### Remote -> Local

```bash
# remote-connected project
cd ~/src/source-remote-project
task-board export /tmp/remote-board.tar.gz

# target local project
cd ~/src/target-local-project
cat > task-board.config.json <<'JSON'
{
  "mode": "local",
